   },
   "title": "Note",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653",
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "widgets_values": [
    "# 09 · Krea 2 General Edit V2 — gentle edits that keep the look\n**Use:** load the picture → write the **instruction** → Run → `S5/edit_krea_*.png`. Turbo, 8 steps, cfg 1, ref boost 4, grounding 768\n(author's recipe). Best of series 5 for **relight**; recolours keep the original texture. **Measured (local 5070 Ti, 2026-10-26):** 30 s incl. model load (1040×1312).\n- ref boost: higher = closer to the picture, lower = freer edit · grounding: lower (512) = follows the instruction harder, higher (1024) = keeps likeness.\n- **Removals:** the author recommends Krea 2 **Raw** (20 steps, cfg 3) — not installed here; use `09_edit_qwen21` (it removed everything in series 5).\n- Identity Edit V2 (restaging a person) stays in `claude-tools\\tools\\s3.py kedit`; never load both Krea edit LoRAs at 1.0 (noise).\n\n| Fix | Use | Why (series 5, same test set) |\n|---|---|---|\n| remove an object | **09_edit_qwen21** | every bike gone, scene kept; Krea Turbo left a distant bike |\n| recolour | 09_edit_qwen21 or 09_edit_krea_general | all models pass; Krea keeps the original look softer |\n| relight | **09_edit_krea_general** | warm light, person kept; Qwen-Edit 2511 repaints the face |\n| background swap | **09_edit_qwen21** | clean new place; Krea keeps leftovers (tram rails) |\n| fix a hand | **09_edit_qwen21** (whole frame) | coherent grip; Krea ignores it; 2511 crop adds tools |\n| outpaint / new aspect | **09_edit_qwen21**, toggle *new canvas size* | grey-pad + fill fails on most models |\n| head swap (last resort) | **09_edit_headswap_bfs** | BFS on Qwen 2.1 keeps the target's expression + light |"
   ]
  },
